                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dawson to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic">September 30,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Dawson reports that the Dominican Government refuses to recognize the award
                    unless 60 per cent of the custom receipts are reserved for administrative
                    expenditures.)</p>
            </div>
